  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "增进亲密感的桌子",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/59244",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=59244",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"59244\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "圆形的桌子有助于拉近彼此的距离，比如这张VIHALS 维哈斯 系列的桌子。每个人都更有参与感，一起聊天谈心，或者加入彩泥创意工作坊中。",
    "增进亲密感的桌子"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20250106/E1FDE574-0FF8-4CB2-8627D308081421D7.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/59244",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20250106/E1FDE574-0FF8-4CB2-8627D308081421D7.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "一位成人和一个孩子坐在一张白色圆形VIHALS 维哈斯 桌子边，桌子下面是一块RIDSTIG 丽德帝格 地毯，上方是一盏米色的BLÅSVERK 布洛威 吊灯。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/content/u/20250106/E1FDE574-0FF8-4CB2-8627D308081421D7.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
